{"id":"pues","lemma":"pues","pos":"conj","rank":216,"glosses":["so, then; in that case","because, since"],"ipa":"/ˈpwes/","order":434,"unit":28,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-pues.wav","examples":[{"text":"-Necesito más. -Pues no hay más.","en":"\"I need more.\" \"Well, there's no more.\"","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/541248","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"more"}]},{"text":"Si tienes hambre, pues come.","en":"If you're hungry, then eat.","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"hunger"},null,{"g":"to eat","l":"comer"}]},{"text":"Pues yo también tengo hambre.","en":"I'm kind of hungry, too.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456672","words":[null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"me too"],[3,5,"I'm hungry"]]}]}